mission "The Last Repair"
    name "The Last Repair"
    description "Find the shipwright at Mermaid's Rest and bring his repair ledger to the fleet."
    source "Stormhaven"
    destination "Mermaid's Rest"
    reward 930
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Stormhaven Engagement: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The free captains need the Meridian Star's repair records to learn how much damage the flagship can survive.`
            `A shipwright who fled the yard is hiding at Mermaid's Rest. He has a copy of the damage ledger and knows which timbers were replaced in haste.`
            `The records will tell you whether the flagship can withstand another full broadside or whether one careful strike could end the chase.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The records will tell you whether the flagship can withstand another full broadside or whether one careful strike could end the chase.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Fen gives you the shipwright's description. “He is no fighter, captain. Bring him back alive and let him do his talking ashore.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Last Repair. Find the shipwright at Mermaid's Rest and bring his repair ledger to the fleet."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The shipwright reveals that the Meridian Star's stern gallery was patched with green timber. It will split if hit repeatedly from the quarter.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Bonny asks you to lead the final pursuit toward Last Light.`
        log "Completed The Last Repair. Received 930 gold. Bonny asks you to lead the final pursuit toward Last Light."
